WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.830
Extract the complete v2 ZIP

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:09.660
In Original, open 00-START-HERE.html, then 01-PLANNER.html in a modern browser

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:14.490
Desktop is recommended for longer editing

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:19.320
No account is required for the planner

00:00:19.320 --> 00:00:24.151
Read the single-business license before reusing the materials.

00:00:24.151 --> 00:00:29.912
In Day 1, set the date and the channel plus format

00:00:29.912 --> 00:00:35.674
For the fictional Cedar Desk studio, use Instagram carousel

00:00:35.674 --> 00:00:41.435
Choose one Caption angle and load the selected template before editing

00:00:41.435 --> 00:00:47.197
Loading another template can replace the current captions, so export a backup first if needed.

00:00:47.197 --> 00:00:51.866
Edit English draft and the Arabic draft separately

00:00:51.866 --> 00:00:56.535
A finished fictional tip is: Before adding another chart, write the one sentence your audience should remember

00:00:56.535 --> 00:01:01.204
Use it as the slide heading

00:01:01.204 --> 00:01:05.873
Replace all bracketed text and verify the translation

00:01:05.873 --> 00:01:10.543
Use only images you own or are allowed to use.

00:01:10.543 --> 00:01:16.145
Use Visual brief to describe the image or short video

00:01:16.145 --> 00:01:21.748
For our example, show a fictional slide before and after simplifying its heading

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:27.351
Mark it Ready only after checking facts, links and image rights

00:01:27.351 --> 00:01:32.954
The planner does not publish posts; publish manually in your chosen channel.

00:01:32.954 --> 00:01:37.738
Use Export backup to save the JSON file after each session

00:01:37.738 --> 00:01:42.522
Keep it with a dated copy of your plan

00:01:42.522 --> 00:01:47.307
Import backup restores the saved plan and may replace your current entries

00:01:47.307 --> 00:01:52.091
Use a disposable test copy for your first recovery check

00:01:52.091 --> 00:01:56.875
Local browser saving alone is not a reliable backup.

00:01:56.875 --> 00:02:02.810
After posting, record views, saves, replies and qualified inquiries in the metrics notes

00:02:02.810 --> 00:02:08.746
Compare similar posts over the same observation period

00:02:08.746 --> 00:02:14.681
Use the worked example for reference, not as proof of results

00:02:14.681 --> 00:02:20.616
Repeat what was useful, and change one thing at a time in the next week.

